# 🚨 CRITICAL BACKEND PROTECTION RULE

DO NOT modify, refactor, rename, restructure, optimize, or reformat ANY existing backend code.

This includes but is not limited to:

- Controllers
- Services
- Business logic
- Entities / Models / DTOs
- Database schema / migrations
- Configuration files
- Environment files
- Existing workflows
- CI/CD files
- Build configurations
- API contracts
- Validation logic
- Authentication flow
- Logging logic
- Exception handling
- Dependency versions
- Docker / Kubernetes files

⚠ Backend workflow must remain 100% untouched.

UI must adapt to backend — NOT vice versa.

